 "title": "TREASURER ONLINE PAYMENTS | Chippewa County",
 "text": "-->\nTREASURER ONLINE PAYMENTS | Chippewa County\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nChippewa\nCounty,\nMichigan\nHOME\nDEPARTMENTS\nADMINISTRATOR'S OFFICE\nBOARD OF COMMISSIONERS\nBUILDING DEPARTMENT\nCLERK\nDRAIN COMMISSION\nEQUALIZATION\nHEALTH DEPARTMENT\nINFORMATION SYSTEMS\nMEDICAL EXAMINER\nMSU EXTENSION\nREGISTER OF DEEDS\nSURVEYOR\nTREASURER\nVeteran Affairs\nLAW & JUSTICE\n50TH CIRCUIT COURT\n91ST DISTRICT COURT\n17th Probate Court\nANIMAL SHELTER\nEMERGENCY 911\nFRIEND OF THE COURT\nJUVENILE COURT\nPROSECUTING ATTORNEY\nPUBLIC DEFENDER\nSHERIFF'S OFFICE\nRELATED SITES\nCHIPPEWA COUNTY INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nCOMMUNITY ACTION\nCONSERVATION DISTRICT\nCommunity Mediation Services\nEUP REGIONAL PLANNING\nEUP TRANSPORTATION AUTHORITY\nHIAWATHA BEHAVIORAL HEALTH\nMICHIGAN WORKS\nMSU EXTENSION\nNORTHERN TRANSITIONS\nROAD COMMISSION\nTOWNSHIPS\nHOW DO I.....\nAPPLY FOR:\nBUILDING PERMIT\nBOARD & COMMITTEE SEAT\nBUSINESS LICENSE\nCONCEALED WEAPONS PERMIT\nDOG LICENSE\nDISABLED VETERAN'S TAX EXEMPTION\nFIND:\nFOIA POLICY\nELECTION RESULTS\nPROPERTY TAX INFORMATION\nBID POSTINGS\nREQUEST:\nBIRTH CERTIFICATE\nCOURT RECORDS\nDEATH RECORDS\nMARRIAGE LICENSE\nPASSPORTS\nPROPERTY INFORMATION\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nChippewa County Treasurer - Online Payments\nTreasurer Home FAQs Foreclosure Timeline\nClick here to look up your delinquent property taxes or contact the Treasurer’s Office (906-635-6308) for the PROPERTY ID NUMBER and CORRECT AMOUNT DUE . Payments cannot be made without this information.\nNOTE: IF YOU MAKE A PAYMENT ON THE WRONG PROPERTY NUMBER, YOUR PAYMENT WILL NOT BE REFUNDED.\nTHE COUNTY TREASURER RESERVES THE RIGHT TO ACCEPT OR DECLINE ANY PAYMENT.\n​\nWe accept full or partial payments on Delinquent Taxes by credit card or debit card. Please note there is a 3% fee, with a minimum of $3.99, that will be added by Government Payment Services on Credit Card payments, and a flat fee of $3.95 on Debit card payments . Service fee charged by GovPay is non-refundable even if payment is rejected by the County Treasures Office\n2023, 2024, 2025\n​\nPay Property Taxes!!!!\nOther Payments\n(DO NOT PAY PROPERTY TAXES WITH)\n​\nbottom of page",
